    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Cold Mastery.</strong> Spells you cast ignore Resistance to Cold damage.</p><p><strong>Frostbite.</strong> When you deal Cold damage to a creature that has the Restrained condition, it takes extra Cold damage equal to a number of d4s equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p>",
